    HALs served by the stock TB-J706F S620150 vendor blobs, and by source-built modules that
    install no VINTF fragment of their own (audio 6.0 wrapper, camera provider, OMX,
    RenderScript). Entries are copied from the stock /vendor/etc/vintf manifest and
    fragments. HALs built from source with their own fragment (display, health, power,
    memtrack, boot, Bluetooth audio, Wi-Fi, Wi-Fi hostapd and supplicant, sensors, USB, CAS,
    vibrator, fingerprint wrapper, atrace) are not listed here.
-->
